00:04:51,1000 --> 00:05:20,519
The previous clip was a good example of what Scout should be doing when his team doesn have much presence in the area but when your team is established and actually occupying the space you defending your role changes Now your job is to prevent threats from reaching your team by pestering them or killing them like this sniper I focused in on to prevent him landing an easy headshot on my heavy or med and clean up easy picks on enemies your power class is already engaging with and safely apply chip damage that forces blue to retreat or delays their push

